    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Game in Early Access!<strong><br><br>\ud83d\ude9a\u2002Create Your Ultimate Food Truck</strong><br><br><br>Start from scratch and turn a rundown vehicle into a fully functional, stylish food truck that stands out on the streets. Paint, decorate, install top-tier cooking equipment - create a space that reflects your flavor and ambition. Your truck is your identity, make it unforgettable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf54\u2002Master the Street Food Craft and Conquer the Streets</strong><br><br>Step into the world of street cuisine and take control of both your kitchen and your wheels. Design a menu that will make customers line up for your food, from juicy burgers and crispy fries to gourmet desserts and secret sauces. But the challenge doesn\u2019t stop there - driving your truck through the busy city is just as important as cooking. Master tight traffic, dodge unexpected obstacles, and manage your time efficiently to serve customers before they lose patience. As you upgrade your menu and unlock seasonal specials, you'll need to adapt to ever-changing customer preferences. Every successful meal, every speedy delivery, and every satisfied customer brings you closer to becoming the undisputed street food king.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcc8\u2002Expand Your Culinary Brand</strong><br><br>With every successful day, unlock upgrades, discover new neighborhoods, and enter food festivals. Compete with rival trucks, attract influencers, and build a loyal following. Your goal? Become a street food legend recognized across the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Wishlist Food Truck Shop Simulator now and start your street food journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Game in Early Access!<strong><br><br>\ud83d\ude9a\u2002Create Your Ultimate Food Truck</strong><br><br><br>Start from scratch and turn a rundown vehicle into a fully functional, stylish food truck that stands out on the streets. Paint, decorate, install top-tier cooking equipment - create a space that reflects your flavor and ambition. Your truck is your identity, make it unforgettable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf54\u2002Master the Street Food Craft and Conquer the Streets</strong><br><br>Step into the world of street cuisine and take control of both your kitchen and your wheels. Design a menu that will make customers line up for your food, from juicy burgers and crispy fries to gourmet desserts and secret sauces. But the challenge doesn\u2019t stop there - driving your truck through the busy city is just as important as cooking. Master tight traffic, dodge unexpected obstacles, and manage your time efficiently to serve customers before they lose patience. As you upgrade your menu and unlock seasonal specials, you'll need to adapt to ever-changing customer preferences. Every successful meal, every speedy delivery, and every satisfied customer brings you closer to becoming the undisputed street food king.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcc8\u2002Expand Your Culinary Brand</strong><br><br>With every successful day, unlock upgrades, discover new neighborhoods, and enter food festivals. Compete with rival trucks, attract influencers, and build a loyal following. Your goal? Become a street food legend recognized across the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Wishlist Food Truck Shop Simulator now and start your street food journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
